The taxi stops in front of a building.
This is my new home.
I get out of the taxi.
I take out my suitcase.
The building's gate is closed.
An elderly guard comes near the gate.
He asks, "Madam, who are you?"
I say, "Hello, my name is Maya."
He asks, "Are you new here?"
I say, "Yes, I am new here."
The guard smiles.
He says, "Welcome, madam."
My suitcase is very heavy.
He opens the gate.
He lifts my suitcase.
I say, "Thank you, kaka."
We go inside.
He happily points toward the stairs.
I go toward the stairs.
